WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:13.120
Looking at the Material Design guidelines, we learn that a button is a component that lets me take an action, so I don't need one for every single action,

2
00:00:13.120 --> 00:00:22.740
putting a button for anything I add to the page, especially when the buttons are all the same type we just covered, say, all filled.

3
00:00:22.740 --> 00:00:32.580
Put several buttons on one screen and it gets annoying: too many actions. I may not need to show all those actions at all; I can group some of them in a menu, for example,

4
00:00:32.580 --> 00:00:43.680
or in any other component that helps the user take an action. But using many buttons on one screen isn't the best, especially of the same type. That's our first guideline.

